    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d191">

                <pb facs="d190-2" n="2" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/d190-2"/>

                <head>191. Telegram 729 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d191-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-09-15">September 15, 1955, 11
                            a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d191-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d191-1"/>
                <p>729. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Word “conferences” in last sentence paragraph 4 my telegram 726 should be
                    corrected read “conference”, that is singular not (repeat not) plural.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Note: FE Message Center notified 9/15/9:36 a.m. EMB (CWO)</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
